<description>&lt;p&gt;Government forces and opposition fighters are clashing in Akobo while governors in Jonglei and Aweil East are urging peace ahead of the first elections scheduled for next month. UN peacekeepers were accused of failing to protect civilians before the Abiemnom massacre that killed at least 213 people, prompting Amnesty International to call for investigations. A CityLink Aviation plane crashed near Juba, killing all 14 aboard, and the ICRC reported ongoing sexual violence against civilians. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPVFoxQmpwenQtQ2xaV1hlMmh1RTNUZHFwWUxMZ3d0aUpQTUgxc2FVVmZDTlBOaUF5cjAwbVRDM2ExTXEzd0poVjluRHFLdTl2ZlNLQ1RUTlM3SmgtWTB6TlV0LUlhM3V4RV8weEhSZVA3M3I3SzRZOHNIMEdlQ0hNV3hrWHVPMGxNNG5V?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPYW42YUZhSUNjMEtPY0l1UDh2N2o1cUdFMU1WRHBnQVpNdTJCNllHT3FvSlpzSEx6cTNKS3JCOWd1OGRqVHo3UjI4dVl0ZjZhaW1iMjJnRE5rYURod3RSVFB3dDNJU1d0RS1QeDd3ZERGLW8xSEF1WENMZnZMcE9qc0JrZzNRZUlibGg2N1ZINllfelN1anFmR1F3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQX2luRkZSZ3VaTUZMd1hDMUJqaGNnQThhNlgzX0FQZWFMbDhjN2R2ZjJIdUZzb0UwMlNkRjhXRWpwUjZOMkFaZG5hczhyZ2ZMcDBtbHBhMFpwYVpmdG1GWEJnSFVIWEUtdEphMzdrRmJGMFE0bmljOFl4TlZJTEZyOVNRSXVWUno0SEROM09FSXM4WndZemx1XzFldVJIanNZQjNzYnJiOFZhYkhjeEFpam1yTkFCYTlxQkU1d2FScVR4UTUtWU04?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9DU1A1RDZfTHZpSkthYlNpN0dUb2FjSzR1THV5Tk80R3h6Qy1DNmg0WW90QmZHWnpCNk1KTkZMd1pjRkRmRzdZR2x5VFRtTG9YejVYRHBpRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.googl